                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Lethal Laser is a laser based tower defense game.\nTower Defense action where you set up a variety of laser defenses to stop oncoming hordes.\nWonderful, innovative, and fun gameplay.\nGraphics the looks fit the futuristic style.\n40 Mission maps.\nNot all levels require careful planning, some are pretty easy even on hard difficulty, other will make you sweat.\nThis game was worth the purchase. It provides you with a great challenge.\nLethal Laser is a well-balanced, challenging tower defense game.\nI was dissapointed that there wasn't any real, interesting story, but the mechanics are just great enough to keep me comming back for wave after wave.",
